### ESP32-S3 → GP8630N

| ESP32-S3  | GP8630N |
| --------- | ------- |
| **GPIO8** | SDA     |
| **GPIO9** | SCL     |
| **3.3V**  | + / VCC |
| **GND**   | − / GND |

### GP8630N → BLD-750

| GP8630N | BLD-750 |
| ------- | ------- |
| **OUT** | SV      |
| **GND** | COM     |

### BLD-750 Control

```text
EN  ── COM
BRK ── COM
F/R ── OPEN

SPEED ── NC
ALM   ── NC
```

### Motor + Hall

```text
Motor Yellow → U
Motor Green  → V
Motor Blue   → W

Hall Red     → REF+
Hall Black   → REF-
Hall Yellow  → HU
Hall Green   → HV
Hall Blue    → HW
```

### Power

```text
Battery + → BLD-750 DC+
Battery - → BLD-750 DC-

ESP32 → USB / Power bank
```

**GPIO used: `GPIO8 = SDA`, `GPIO9 = SCL`.**
